1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Kauppias Author Duvallin vaimo. Turku ja Oulu. Kauppias Jakob Persson Trumbellin vaimo, Oulu.
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Handelsman Author Duvalls hustru. Åbo och Uleåborg, Finland. Handelsman Jakob Persson Trumbells hustru. Uleåborg.''
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Merchant Author Duvall's wife. Turku and Oulu, Finland. Merchant Jakob Persson Trumbell's wife. Oulu.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''HUOM! Author Duvallin alkuperä ei ole tiedossa. Hänen on arveltu olleen skotti, saksalainen tai hollantilainen.''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''OBS! Author Duvall's anor är inte kända. Det har spekularets att han var skotsk, tysk eller holländsk.''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''NOTE! Author Duvall's origin is not known. The has been speculations that he was a Scott, German or Dutch.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Keskustelua - diskussion - discussion:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://suku.genealogia.fi/archive/index.php/t-11807.html
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Veli-Pekka Toropainen: Skottirotta ja Ruotsin koira - Turun ulkomaalainen porvaristo vuosina 1600-1660: (Scottish rat and Swedish dog - foreign merchants in Turku during 1600-1660), Genos 74 (2003), p. 199-215
2 CONT
2 CONT p. 208: (in English) Duvall, Author, German. Merchant 1625. Buried 10.5.1636. Spouse Elisabet Hansdr. Platz, German. Wife's 2. spouse Jacob Perss. Trumbell, German*. - ref. 71: Carpelan 1809:155; Hausen 1901:125.
2 CONT
2 CONT p. 211: (in English) Platz, Hans, German. Mayor 1616-1620. Deputy 1617. Died 1620. Spouse Brita Henriksdr. Storck. - ref. 125: von Bonsdorff 1892-1894:202; Carpelan 1890: 155.
2 CONT
2 CONT p. 212: (in English) Trumbell, Jacob Persson, Scottish*. Merchant 8.7.1637. Denounced his merchant rights 4.1.1648 in order to move to Oulu. Spouse Elisabet Hansdr. Platz, German. Wife's 1. spouse Arthur Duval, German. - ref. 153:
2 CONC  Nyholm 1977:171-172.
