1 NAME Maria Helena Michelsdotter /Knekta/
2 GIVN Maria Helena Michelsdotter
2 SURN Knekta
1 NAME Maria Helena Michelsdotter /Knekta/
2 GIVN Maria Helena Michelsdotter
2 SURN Knekta
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 20 JUL 1828
2 ADDR
3 CITY Tärendö
3 CTRY Sverige
1 BAPM
2 DATE 31 AUG 1828
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1891
2 PLAC Elvenes
2 ADDR
3 STAE Troms
