2 CONT They are mentioned under "Backstugusittare, inhyseshjon". Backstug means a very little house, those people lived in small houses, usually one room and the worked for someone else. They had no land. Inhyseshjon is quite sad word, i
2 CONC t means "parasites". Those were so poor other people had to help them.
