1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ida was born in November 1869 and was baptized 27 February 1870. She was the illegitimate daughter of Karl Grape and Brita Mattsdotter Kelottijarvi. In the 1900 Census  for Lyngen she lived at Storsteinnes. In 1902
2 CONC  she married Sivert Josefsen.Ida worked as a housewife and took care of the animals in the cowshed. Ida passed away in 1966. She was buried at Eidebakken cementery in Lyngseidet  17 December 1966.
